---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro'
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro'
import { contacts, site } from '../../data/site'
---

<Section id="contrato" width="6xl">
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-panel)] p-8 text-center sm:p-14"
  >
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-24 mx-auto h-48 w-3/4 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-ring-red)]/20 blur-3xl"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>

    <p class="kicker mb-5">El contrato · Última llamada</p>
    <h2 class="headline text-[clamp(2rem,7.5vw,4rem)] text-balance">
      <span class="text-chrome">30.000 candidaturas.</span><br />
      <span class="text-fire">Tú decides quién sube al ring.</span>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-muted)] sm:text-lg"
    >
      Busco el reto que me ponga contra las cuerdas: construir y sostener la tecnología de un evento
      que millones de personas van a mirar a la vez. Si mi perfil encaja con lo que buscas, aquí me
      tienes — listo para firmar.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        contacts.map((contact) => (
          <a
            href={contact.href}
            target={contact.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined}
            rel={contact.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noreferrer' : undefined}
            class="group flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-void)]/60 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--color-belt-gold)]/50"
          >
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-line)] text-[var(--color-belt-gold)] transition-colors group-hover:border-[var(--color-belt-gold)]/50">
              <Icon path={contact.icon} />
            </span>
            <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <span class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--color-faint)] uppercase">
                {contact.label}
              </span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] leading-snug [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--color-bone)] sm:text-sm">
                {contact.value}
              </span>
            </span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Firma%20del%20cartel%20-%20La%20Velada`}
        class="btn btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto"
      >
        Firmar el contrato ahora
      </a>
      <a href="#cartelera" class="btn btn-ghost w-full sm:w-auto">Revisar el cartel otra vez</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
